 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Flatness descends over a unit-ideal localization span",
 "statement": "Let $R$ be a commutative ring, $N$ an $R$-module, and $s\\subset R$ a set with $\\operatorname{Ideal.span}(s)=\\top$. If $N_f$ is flat over $R_f$ for every $f\\in s$, then $N$ is flat over $R$ [def-weil-pbc-flat-ring-map].",
